## What was delivered

1. Ported `cyclex.api.token` + Bearer binding from Cursor Mobile PR #1 into live track-repo.
2. Login/verify return `token` + `token_expiry`; logout revokes tokens.
3. Session cookies still work (backward compatible).
4. Fixed `customer_rank` guard and wallet currency ACL.
5. Full Postman/Newman regression on live `:8071`.

## Auth usage (mobile)

```http
POST /api/cyclex/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"+20…","password":"…"}
```

Response includes `results.token`. Then:

```http
Authorization: Bearer <token>
```

